    x: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `bfloat16`, `half`, `float32`, `float64`, `int8`, `uint8`, `int16`, `uint16`, `int32`, `uint32`, `int64`, `uint64`.
    y: A `Tensor`. Must have the same type as `x`.
